{"nodes": [{"id": "notebooks_md_kaggle__finished__wahy_laya_finetuning_run6_finished", "label": "Notebook: Run 6 - envelope v3 (pruned v2 + golden v1 layout), verdict only", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "notebooks/md/kaggle__finished__wahy-laya-finetuning-run6-finished.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sixth run. Envelope v3: corpus text at top (source_type, candidate_reference, canonical_corpus_text), no neighbor_findings blobs, keep lexical boundary cues (immediate_transcript_before/after, unmatched_corpus_prefix/suffix_words, prefix/suffix_words_heard), ayah text deduplicated, max length 2048. 2 epochs, batch 64, RLCD, ~25-30 min. Hub repos laya-wahy-r6-<run>. Decision rule: AUC >= 0.94, accuracy >= 90 percent, real rejected <= 7 percent. Per project notes v3_mixed won in passage mode and is the production Laya model."}, {"id": "notebooks_md_kaggle__finished__wahy_laya_finetuning_run6_finished_v3_single", "label": "Run 6 v3_single (single verses only, envelope v3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "notebooks/md/kaggle__finished__wahy-laya-finetuning-run6-finished.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Built from DATA/base converted with to_v3_state. Asks whether the clean v3 envelope preserves or beats ~0.94 AUC on single verses. cfg wahy_envelope 3, passages false."}, {"id": "notebooks_md_kaggle__finished__wahy_laya_finetuning_run6_finished_v3_mixed", "label": "Run 6 v3_mixed (single verses + multi-verse passages, envelope v3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "notebooks/md/kaggle__finished__wahy-laya-finetuning-run6-finished.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single-verse rows plus passage rows with verses > 1 (not already seen). Fixes run 5's loss of single-verse sensitivity while k